==Hungarian==

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|de|hu}} {{term|Partie|lang=de}}, from the {{etyl|fr|hu}} {{term|partie||part|lang=fr}}, from {{term|partir||to divide|lang=fr}}, from the {{etyl|la|hu}} {{term|partire||to separete|lang=la}}, from {{term|pars||part|lang=la}}. The "social gathering" meaning is from the {{etyl|en|hu}} {{term|party|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|/'pɒrti/|lang=hu}}
*{{hyphenation|par|ti}}

===Noun===
{{hu-noun|k}}

# {{obsolete|lang=hu}} a [[marriageable]] person, [[eligible]] partner
# {{gaming|lang=hu}} a [[game]] of (e.g. [[cards]], [[chess]])
# {{gaming|lang=hu}} [[party]]
# [[party]] ''(social gathering)''

